            and other database categories.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='faq-item'>
          <div class='faq-question'>
            Is the website mobile friendly?
          </div>
          <div class='faq-answer'>
            Yes. The design is responsive and works on desktop,
            tablet and mobile screens.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


